{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仕", "id": "仕"}, {"form": "入", "id": "入"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "肉", "id": "肉"}, {"form": "託", "id": "託"}, {"form": "諸侯", "id": "諸侯"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}, {"form": "際", "id": "際"}, {"form": "餽", "id": "餽"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.3933394562625097, "source": "餽", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.3096301881366648, "source": "餽", "target": "肉"}, {"weight": 0.994622575144062, "source": "後", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.5824092400461809, "source": "後", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.093234863812172, "source": "後", "target": "託"}, {"weight": 1.1124056108004454, "source": "後", "target": "諸侯"}, {"weight": 1.8055527913603908, "source": "門", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 3.3096301881366648, "source": "門", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 3.597312260588446, "source": "門", "target": "入"}, {"weight": 2.3933394562625097, "source": "門", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.3096301881366648, "source": "門", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 2.498699971920336, "source": "外", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 4.00277736869661, "source": "外", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 3.597312260588446, "source": "入", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 2.7863820443721172, "source": "仕", "target": "際"}, {"weight": 2.344549292093078, "source": "士", "target": "託"}, {"weight": 1.3637200390813515, "source": "士", "target": "諸侯"}, {"weight": 1.1405764877671418, "source": "士", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.2459370034249682, "source": "士